# Transactional Emails Package (`packages/transactional`)
# Transactional Emails Package (`packages/transactional`)

This package manages all transactional emails sent by the application, using React Email for templating.

## Key Files & Directories:
- **[`emails/`](mdc:packages/transactional/emails)**: Contains the React components for each email template.
- **[`src/`](mdc:packages/transactional/src)**: Core utilities and shared components for email templates.
  - **[`components/`](mdc:packages/transactional/src/components)**: Reusable React components like `BaseEmail`, `Button`, and `Footer`.
  - **[`constants.ts`](mdc:packages/transactional/src/constants.ts)**: Shared constants, including URLs, support email, and supported locales.
  - **[`utils/getLocale.ts`](mdc:packages/transactional/src/utils/getLocale.ts)**: Utility to resolve the user's locale for email internationalization.
  - **[`index.ts`](mdc:packages/transactional/src/index.ts)**: Main entry point, exporting all necessary email components and utilities.
- **[`package.json`](mdc:packages/transactional/package.json)**: Defines dependencies (`react-email`, `@react-email/components`) and scripts.
- **[`tsconfig.json`](mdc:packages/transactional/tsconfig.json)**: TypeScript configuration for the package.

## Notes
- Emails are built with [React](mdc:.cursor/rules/lib/react.mdc) and support internationalization (i18n).
- The package is self-contained and can be run in development mode to preview emails.
- Styling is done with [Tailwind CSS](mdc:.cursor/rules/lib/tailwind.mdc).
